title One model request through the adapter seam

loop    "agent-loop"
runtime "LlmRuntime"
adapter "DeepSeekAdapter"
api     "DeepSeek API"
asm     "BlockAssembler"
log     "Session record"
pieces  "Pieces read" counter 0

loop -> runtime -> adapter -> api
api -> adapter
adapter -> runtime
runtime -> loop
loop -> asm
asm -> log

req at loop

# The loop needs a reply but must not know which provider sends it.
pause "The request names provider deepseek and model deepseek-flash, nothing more."

# The runtime picks the adapter that was registered for the provider name.
req -> runtime "One map from provider name to adapter."
req -> adapter

# Only the adapter knows DeepSeek's own request shape and address.
req -> api : waiting "One POST to /anthropic/v1/messages with stream set to true."

# DeepSeek's events come back, and the adapter turns each one into a shared piece.
new text at api
text -> adapter
text -> runtime "A text-delta piece, in the shared list of seven types."
text -> loop
text -> asm
pieces +1

# The last piece is a finish, so the stream ends and the request is done.
new fin at api
fin -> adapter
fin -> runtime
fin -> loop
fin -> asm "Finish kind stop: nothing comes after it."
pieces +1
req : done

# The assembler gives whole blocks, and the loop writes them to the record.
remove text
fin -> log : done "The record holds the assistant message, not the provider's events."
